{"term":{"label":"心","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"3B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii","title":"滕文公下","description":"陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"丈","id":"丈"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仕","id":"仕"},{"form":"作","id":"作"},{"form":"兄","id":"兄"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"命","id":"命"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"孔子","id":"孔子"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"欲","id":"欲"},{"form":"殺","id":"殺"},{"form":"母","id":"母"},{"form":"父","id":"父"},{"form":"說","id":"說"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.586965056582042,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":0.7396671961948382,"source":"人","target":"母"},{"weight":0.7396671961948382,"source":"人","target":"父"},{"weight":0.3829922522561057,"source":"人","target":"國"},{"weight":0.3829922522561057,"source":"人","target":"仕"},{"weight":0.8938178760220965,"source":"人","target":"欲"},{"weight":2.921143416562918,"source":"說","target":"作"},{"weight":2.426066149765067,"source":"母","target":"命"},{"weight":2.243744592971112,"source":"母","target":"心"},{"weight":2.4950590212520183,"source":"母","target":"父"},{"weight":1.7329189692051217,"source":"母","target":"國"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"母","target":"兄"},{"weight":2.649209701079277,"source":"母","target":"殺"},{"weight":2.0693912058263346,"source":"命","target":"丈"},{"weight":2.426066149765067,"source":"命","target":"父"},{"weight":1.7329189692051217,"source":"丈","target":"父"},{"weight":2.243744592971112,"source":"父","target":"心"},{"weight":1.7329189692051217,"source":"父","target":"國"},{"weight":0.7774075241776851,"source":"父","target":"子"},{"weight":1.8382794848629478,"source":"父","target":"君"},{"weight":2.0693912058263346,"source":"仕","target":"國"},{"weight":1.8870696490323797,"source":"仕","target":"欲"},{"weight":1.0116009116784799